A||||9||CanadianGT||Fire gets my Fiero||||1||
Z||000000||CanadianGT||07-04-2001||08:46 AM||||Well I cant believe it.  I have had my 86 GT at a rebuilders for over 3 months now for a 5 day job, and it finally get's done, but a Fire ruins it.  NO , not a fire caused by my Fiero, but one that mysteriously started over the long weekend at there shop when all the mechanics were away.  I called yesterday to get my car, and he say's " we have some bad news"  "our shop went up in flames".  He says the fire departement got there in time to put it out, before my car caught fire, but instead of being red now, the entire body is black, and there is a real funky smell coming from inside.  Basically my car is ruined.  I have already paid the guy $1800 of the $3000 I owe him, and what will I get in return? A charcolled Fiero.  I have invested over $8000 in this car since I bought it 1 year and a half ago and I have nothing left.  Im only 19, and that is a lot of money to me.  On top of that I no longer have any transportation to college this fall.  The Mechanic aparently has no insurance, and I only have Liability coverage.  I think the only option I have left is to sue the guy, but even that is no guarantee.  The worst part of all this is, my Mom still has still not found out yet.  BOY AM I EVER GONNA HEAR IT!!!  On top of all that bad news about my Fiero yesterday, I come on here and the place was shut down!!  Oh well, I hope I did not bore you to much with my ranting and raving.  I guess im in the market for another Fiero now.<BR>PeAcE<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
